      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAIRPLAY (2) drew wider and worked before toughing out a win last start, his sixth success in seven starts this campaign. That was his first outing for six weeks so it should have improved him and he gets every chance from this draw. STORMS COLLIDE (6) set a new track record when he led from this barrier and went on to beat a Group 1 winner at Swan Hill last start. Should run another big race. YAMBUKIAN (4) was a big improver in his second outing off a long spell when beaten just a head last week. Strikes at 50 per cent when third-up so could progress further. BULLETPROOF BOY (10) and SOME AMERICAN (12) are both good enough to win with even luck from back row draws.",
